      "content": "Feeling like you are a burden or a source of inevitable pain for your children is an immense burden to carry. However, deciding to end your life is not a definitive act of stopping the rot; it only ends your ability to heal or change. Your worth is not determined by the perceived mistakes of those who came before you, nor by the fear of future pain. Please reach out to a crisis line immediately—there are people who want to help you find a way through this unbearable feeling.",
